    {
      "source": "<a href=\"../../autoconfigure/EnableAutoConfiguration.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.boot.autoconfigure\"><code>Auto-configuration</code></a> for RSocket servers. In the case of\n<a href=\"../../WebApplicationType.html#REACTIVE\"><code>WebApplicationType.REACTIVE</code></a>, the RSocket server is\nadded as a WebSocket endpoint on the existing\n<a href=\"../../reactor/netty/NettyWebServer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.reactor.netty\"><code>NettyWebServer</code></a>. If a specific server\nport is configured, a new standalone RSocket server is created.",
      "translation": "用于 RSocket 服务器的<a href=\"../../autoconfigure/EnableAutoConfiguration.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.boot.autoconfigure\"><code>自动配置</code></a>。在<a href=\"../../WebApplicationType.html#REACTIVE\"><code>WebApplicationType.REACTIVE</code></a>的情况下，RSocket 服务器作为 WebSocket 端点添加到现有的<a href=\"../../reactor/netty/NettyWebServer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.reactor.netty\"><code>NettyWebServer</code></a>中。如果配置了特定的服务器端口，则会创建一个新的独立 RSocket 服务器。",
      "count": 2
    },
